      "content": "yeah. and it's not even like they're being mean or anything, they just... they look right through me. like i'm not even a person. i tried to go to the library yesterday and i saw them all laughing together and i just had to leave because it felt like i was suffocating. it feels so permanent. like there's no coming back from this. how am i even supposed to keep doing this every day? it's just constant, heavy emptiness.",
